      "requirement": "If property is offered for rent within five years of a no-fault eviction under section 98.0704(b)(1), (3), or (4), the landlord must first offer it in writing to the displaced tenant who timely requested renewal and provided contact details; the landlord may screen using industry accepted methods with criteria communicated in the offer, and the tenant has 30 days to accept.",
